WEBVTT

00:39:56.413 --> 00:40:01.329
As I was trying to give birth to my eleven
pound baby boy and I was thinking,

00:40:01.496 --> 00:40:06.746
I can't do this. And I want what the
deepest voice in me said, you know,

00:40:06.746 --> 00:40:08.746
you can you know, you can.

00:40:09.454 --> 00:40:12.913
Nine days after your hike and a few
days after your 27th birthday,

00:40:12.913 --> 00:40:15.996
you met your husband through
someone who came to

00:40:15.996 --> 00:40:18.996
the yard sale you had selling
your hiking gear to raise

00:40:18.996 --> 00:40:20.496
a little bit of money to live on.

00:40:21.454 --> 00:40:24.413
Several years later, you married him,
you had two children.

00:40:24.746 --> 00:40:26.829
Do you think that this sort of new life,

00:40:26.829 --> 00:40:30.413
big quotes was the gift you got
at the end of a long struggle?